# Sprint 0 Tasks

### Task 1

Create the extension.

```bash
npm init
```

---

### Task 2

Install dependencies.

```bash
npm install
```

---

### Task 3

Register commands.

```typescript
registerCommand("uriel.newProject")

registerCommand("uriel.newCharacter")

registerCommand("uriel.newScene")
```

---

### Task 4

Add Activity Bar.

```
Uriel Studio
```

with a custom icon.

---

### Task 5

Create TreeDataProvider.

```text
Manuscript

Characters

World

Prophecies

Codex
```

---

### Task 6

Create Project Generator.

When executed:

```
Uriel: New Project
```

creates

```text
URIEL_CHRONICLES/
```

and the folders automatically.

---

### Task 7

Load snippets.

Copy

```
uriel.code-snippets
```

into

```
.vscode/
```

---

### Task 8

Create templates.

```
chapter.md

character.md

scene.md

artifact.md
```

---

### Task 9

Build.

```
F5
```

opens Extension Development Host.

---

